A||||8||The Fieromaster||Enroute To Fiero Show Kill Story!||||10||
Z||000000||The Fieromaster||08-14-2001||03:00 AM||||Well after getting an interesting e-mail from a person undesclosed.  I proved them wrong on the way to the IL Fiero show! Here is the content of the mail!...<P>Look fiero's are a nice little car I have an 86 and 87 but they are not performance. I have a stock 95 Neon that blow your doors off at any speed or RPM.<P>NOW thats BS cause on the way to the show i SPANKED and i mean SPANKED a Neon R/T that was all modded out! It even had a NICE chrome dual exhaust!!  Oh well i guess everyone can have opinions though... even if they are crazy!<P>Also i JUST got back from Mentor and i ran into a dude with a 3000GT and we went to the "Snakes Crossing" (street drag area) and did a little dualing!  Unfortunatly i didnt do so well!  I can chuck it up to a few problems though (yea i know excuses excuses) but i have a engine code for somthing (checkin tomarow mornin) and she is runnin WAY RICH... so bad that i leave clouds of gas in my full throttle wake!!  So once i get all that taken care of were gonna duke it out again!  Was cool though he passed me in 1st and pulled in 2nd then 3rd i started to gain and my 4th i coulda rear ended him but we had to slow cause to po-po finder went off!  Oh well... another day perhaps after i get my baby fixed!  Was cool though cause after we stopped all he had was Fiero praise!!!  "These cars are sweet!" "There fast man if you do some stuff" and so on!  Long live the Fiero!<P>------------------<BR>      <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">         <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B>||||reg||10
Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-14-2001||04:32 AM||||Nice kill. You know alot of small cars these days are packed w/ power....the Neon, however, ehhh, well, you know.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>I couldnt tell you how many Neons I come across at red lights that wanna "go". It usually sad...they get so far behind I rarely get the chance to meet up with them again (wait for them that is) so I can give them the sarcastic "uh huh". <BR>BTW, what did  the Mr. Neon you raced have to say for himself?<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||7
Z||000002||SlingBlade||08-14-2001||08:36 AM||||For real... I read in a mag a few years back that the neon R/T was the number 2 car in the dodge lineup performance wise. Second only to Viper. I don't remeber what mag, but I bet the neon racers have got it framed. LOL||||reg||1
Z||000003||FieroMaster88||08-14-2001||01:30 PM||||If that 3000GT was a VR4 and you were catchin up with it...i have a feeling it has some problems.  Like I said, I was keepin up with the Stealth R/T, so I know it was not a trubo.  <P>OOh yeah...and the R/T Neon is NOT the second fastest car in dodges lineup.  I think the Dakota R/T is...but Defenatly not the Neon.  If they think it is that is total  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">             <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo<p>[This message has been edited by FieroMaster88 (edited 08-14-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||The Fieromaster||08-14-2001||02:36 PM||||James, James, James.. You pedder you know i wouldnt try a VR4... ok I would but wouldnt say here about the race cause without the IHI in the car id get stomped!!<P>As for what the dude said... Man I missed a shift     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">    we were doin like friggin MACH on the freeway he should not have HAD to shift... hmm sounds like     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">    to me!!<P>PS.. CLIFF love the new smilies! haha<P><BR>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif"><BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">          <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT></B><p>[This message has been edited by The Fieromaster (edited 08-14-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000005||falconhulk||08-16-2001||03:47 PM||||Sorry you just got to know the Neon driver was bad.  No matter what you think they are fast cars.  I have had one since 96 and wone more light to lights then I can tell you.  No one ever wants to be beat by something called a "neon" but they are good cars. I have not had one problem with it and its been driven HARD!  By the way I currently have the following:<BR>87 Firebird<BR>78 Cobra II (350 HP KICK A$$ CAR That everyone mistakes as a slow car also)<BR>85 fiero se<BR>98 Expedition <BR>96 Neon<BR>I love all my cars and that neon definitely deserves respect.||||reg||1
Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||08-16-2001||04:34 PM||||how does your car stand up to a Neon?  Check this link... <A HREF="http://users.planetcable.net/funkz/carspecs.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://users.planetcable.net/funkz/carspecs.htm</A><P>It doesn't list the Fiero specifically, but gives a pretty good comparison of numbers:<P>1999 Dodge Neon R/T: 0-60 @ 7.5sec.  1/4mi @ 15.8sec. (150bhp engine)<P>I have yet to see a stock Neon that can impress me... there is a local kid with a Nitrous Neon that runs pretty hot- still not THAT fast though.||||reg||1
Z||000007||FieroJoe||08-16-2001||09:57 PM||||Haha craig, your car runs so rich nobody wanted to follow you because of the flames that shot out your exhaust!<P>And I remember when that neon went fartin by us, I was just waiting for you to hop out of line and chase him!||||reg||1
Z||000008||falconhulk||08-17-2001||08:28 AM||||Ya know there was a time when people thought the fiero was "too cute" and not to be take seriously also. Be open minded.  Stock Fiero is 0 to 60 in 8.0 stock.  In reality most stoplight to stoplight races only get to 60.  I agree that the fiero is wayyyyy more fun and takes curves for lunch .  But the neon is a good car.  Never let me down yet and its plenty fast.||||reg||1
